 R←Test_38(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;html
⍝ A `customFns` that crashes is reported in the HTML report together with what the application put into `addToMsg`
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 #.⎕SHADOW'HandleErrorParms'
 #.HandleErrorParms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 #.HandleErrorParms.saveErrorWS←0
 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.HandleErrorParms.addToMsg←'Set by the application'
 #.TEMP.⎕FX'∆CustomFns ps' '∘∘∘'
 #.HandleErrorParms.customFns←'#.TEMP.∆CustomFns'
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder
 {}'CREATE!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder

 ⎕TRAP←(405 'E' '406 ##.HandleError.Process #.HandleErrorParms')(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 :Trap 406
     {⎕SIGNAL ⍵}405
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap

 →T.GoToTidyUp 406≠⎕EN
 list←FilesAndDirs.ListFiles #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder,'/*.html'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢list
 html←⊃⎕NGET⊃list
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Set by the application'⍷html
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'customFns failed:'⍷html
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'SYNTAX ERROR'⍷html

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder
